{"parse": {"title": "洛基-07", "pageid": 94309, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E5%9F%BA-06\" title=\"洛基-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">洛基-07</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">洛基</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.99.BD\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"白\">白</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 白</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">White</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:200%\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\">妈咪，你看，我学会骑马了。</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div><i><span style=\"font-size:166%\"> <span style=\"color:#6F6660\"><br /><br /><br />嗯，很棒哦。</span></span></i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div>妈咪很喜欢我，这点我是确信的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:200%\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\">妈咪，这是我画的。</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div><i><span style=\"font-size:166%\"> <span style=\"color:#6F6660\"><br /><br /><br />很不错，好乖呀。</span></span></i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div>她永远用温和宽容的态度对待我，永远鼓励我，赞美我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:200%\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\">妈咪，你可以听听我新学的钢琴曲吗？</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div><i><span style=\"font-size:166%\"> <span style=\"color:#6F6660\"><br /><br /><br />你弹吧，妈咪还要与叔叔阿姨们聊事情，妈咪坐在客厅里听。</span></span></i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div>但我总觉得……她从来没有试图触碰我的自我，仿佛我只要“好”，她就满足了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div>直到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:200%\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\">妈咪，早上，我听见小厨房的阿姨们在聊天……</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div><i><span style=\"font-size:166%\"> <span style=\"color:#6F6660\"><br /><br /><br />怎么了？</span></span></i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:200%\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\">阿姨说，她……</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div>母亲的眼睛正盯着我，她在等我讲下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div>我突然意识到，我发现了一个钩子，能够将妈咪的注意力一直留在我这里的钩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div>我要摸到它，然后向妈咪展现出她从来都没有正视过的，我的自我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:200%\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\">阿姨说，她……她早上去买菜的时候，钱包丢掉了。</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div><i><span style=\"font-size:166%\"> <span style=\"color:#6F6660\"><br /><br /><br />嗯？然后呢？</span></span></i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:200%\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\">阿姨沿着来时的路到处找，最后只能去报警了。</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div><i><span style=\"font-size:166%\"> <span style=\"color:#6F6660\"><br /><br /><br />嗯……</span></span></i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div>妈咪的注意力似乎涣散了，这或许是因为她猜透了故事的谜底。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:200%\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\">但是呢！</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div>我提高了音量，想要抓住她的吸引力，我必须想到一个能够推翻现阶段故事的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:200%\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\">她发现，是她的口袋破了，钱包掉到裤子的夹层里了。</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div><i><span style=\"font-size:166%\"> <span style=\"color:#6F6660\"><br /><br /><br />所以钱包压根没有丢喽？</span></span></i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:200%\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\">但……但其实……这是我昨晚做的一个梦。</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div>全是我编的，我用一个谎言换取了妈咪的关注，用一个谎言圆了另一个谎言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-502401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div><i><span style=\"font-size:166%\"> <span style=\"color:#6F6660\"><br /><br /><br />呀，这种事下次要早说呀。</span></span></i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:200%\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\">早说的话，我要靠什么来吸引你的注意力呢。</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>妈咪走开了，仿佛像是走进了一片事务编织起的浓雾中，在那里，她不止是母亲，还是商人，是老板，是承接人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>是五颜六色汇聚成的一片白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:200%\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\">也是最能凸显颜色的一片白。</span></span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div>如果没有这片白色，红色也不会显现出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-630201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小菲林士多：</div><div>嘘……这是她自己都没发现的事哦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div> <br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><span style=\"color:#000000\"><br /><span style=\"font-size:138%\"><span style=\"text-align:right\">白  1991</span></span></span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_dianyinggongzuoshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_dianyinggongzuoshi\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_dianyinggongzuoshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-2_5_bg_dianyinggongzuoshi.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_dianyinggongzuoshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-2_5_bg_dianyinggongzuoshi.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_dianyinggongzuoshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/Cg-2_5_bg_dianyinggongzuoshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_dianyinggongzuoshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>哦，来电了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莹白的白炽灯光突然点亮了整个房间，如今的电影工作室与之前卖掉的那个所差无几。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>第一部电影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张旧合照。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不得不依赖的轮椅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>一件件物品摆在这里，就像人生的侧写，但这些还远远不够，无法组成一个真实的我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多的头向右轻轻侧着，手指绕着自己的短发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>绿灯……难道绿灯的隐喻就足够了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她若有所思着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>或者，应该改变一下颜色登场的顺序？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她念念有词着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>在墓前，奇星会对我那么生气……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多的左手随意地向前摆了摆，木偶们便都回到了轮椅中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>是不是因为……我只有这种时候才能想到阿君？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她思考着，轮椅缓慢地将她带回了电脑前。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_at_pianchang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_at_pianchang1\"><img alt=\"2_5_at_pianchang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Cg-2_5_at_pianchang1.png/600px-Cg-2_5_at_pianchang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Cg-2_5_at_pianchang1.png/900px-Cg-2_5_at_pianchang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Cg-2_5_at_pianchang1.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_at_pianchang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>你以为刚才的一切是什么？是回忆，还是一个故事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>你相信了吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_at_pianchang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_at_pianchang2\"><img alt=\"2_5_at_pianchang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_5_at_pianchang2.png/600px-Cg-2_5_at_pianchang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_5_at_pianchang2.png/900px-Cg-2_5_at_pianchang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_5_at_pianchang2.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_at_pianchang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多打开机箱的电源，一片红色蒙上了菲林士多的面容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>故事是谎言，这件事永远不会改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>而你正是故事的读者，所以，一切都交予你来评判。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "洛基-07"}}